WEBVTT

00:02:58.996 --> 00:03:01.163
and it came from magical thinking.

00:03:01.704 --> 00:03:04.038
On this xeroxed piece of paper,

00:03:04.038 --> 00:03:06.954
the crash had not yet happened.

00:03:07.496 --> 00:03:09.954
Abed could still turn his wheel left

00:03:09.954 --> 00:03:12.913
so that I would see him
whoosh by out my window.

00:03:12.954 --> 00:03:14.663
and I would remain whole.

00:03:15.246 --> 00:03:17.204
"Be careful, Abed, look out.

00:03:17.246 --> 00:03:18.788
Slow down."

00:03:19.538 --> 00:03:21.954
But Abed did not slow,

00:03:21.996 --> 00:03:25.204
and on that xeroxed piece of paper,
my neck again broke,

00:03:25.246 --> 00:03:27.913
and again, I was left without anger.

00:03:29.704 --> 00:03:32.163
I decided to find Abed,